This License governs only the Licensed Work expressly identified below and in the applicable `LICENSE-SCOPE.md` file for a release. It does not grant rights to MOHIO trademarks, logos, brand assets, hosted services, enterprise services, private repositories, official paid services, official langmaps, certified/custom sector profiles, signing keys, proprietary backends, or other materials not expressly included in the Licensed Work.

MOHIO is developed as an open-core language platform. This License is intended to permit broad use of the Mohio Public Core for building and running applications while reserving commercial licensing for Mohio-as-a-platform, hosted runtime/compiler/server/studio offerings, competing platform offerings, certified/custom sector profiles, official langmaps, advanced compliance/audit/governance services, and enterprise components.

