The “Licensed Work” means the Mohio Public Core, consisting only of the Mohio compiler, Mohio command-line tooling, Mohio public runtime components, public examples, and other source files expressly identified as licensed under the Business Source License 1.1 in the `LICENSE-SCOPE.md` file included with each applicable release.

The Licensed Work does not include, unless expressly identified in `LICENSE-SCOPE.md` for the applicable release:

